# career_coach is one tree, two layers.
# Tracked (the product, shareable, zero personal data): AGENTS.md, README.md,
#   CHANGELOG.md, MANIFEST.schema.md, hats/, standards/, scripts/, tests/,
#   .github/ (the CI workflow).
# Gitignored (the instance, per-user, private): everything the user owns,
#   all of it under instance/ — including the store db (instance/db/) and its
#   WAL sidecars, and the generated exports (ledger.tsv, logs/).
/instance/

# sqlite artifacts, wherever a db is created (defense in depth; the store db
# lives under instance/ above)
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# In-progress working artifacts at the root: drafts of mechanism docs that
# carry instance data while they are being written. Never tracked.
store-design.md
store-plan.md

.DS_Store
